<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιείκεια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reasonableness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει τινὰ οὗτος ὁ λόγος ἐπιείκειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>equity</i>, opp. strict law, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				141a16
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιείκειαν</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τοὺς ὅρκους</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				18.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαμπτον εἰς ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. of persons,
				<i>reasonableness, fairness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				735a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ πρᾳότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				10.1
			</span></i>; also, <i>goodness, virtuousness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				16.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.207
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1175b24
			</span></i>: pl., joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριτες</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.63
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.149
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
			personified, <u>Clemency</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				57
			</span></i>.</div>
